<title>USA: Golden Books completes Penn Corp unit sale.</title>
<headline>Golden Books completes Penn Corp unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golden Books Family Entertainment Inc said on Tuesday it completed the previously announced sale of Golden Books unit Penn Corp stock to Peacock Papers Inc.</p>
<p>Penn Corp's primary asset is Beach Products, which makes party goods, Golden Books said.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Golden Books is a children's book publishing company.</p>
</text>
